2026-04-04 06:28:32.144 | 113525 (113525) | DEBUG    | Model response text: I've analyzed `OutlineManager` and `SidebarOutlineManager`. Currently, they suffer from significant logic and UI duplication (especially the `SortableItem` component and project manipulation handlers). I will refactor them into a modular, DRY architecture within the `builder` workspace.

### Refactoring Plan: Modular Outline Architecture

#### 1. Consolidate Primitives (`src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/outline/`)
*   **`SortableOutlineItem.tsx`**: Extract the UI for a single chapter/section node. This will be the single source of truth for the "Intelligence Suite" tactile feel (drag handles, status dots, inline editing).
*   **`useOutlineOperations.ts`**: Create a shared hook to encapsulate all project-level mutations (Move, Update, Delete, Duplicate, Copy/Paste). This eliminates the duplication between `OutlineManager` and `SidebarOutlineManager`.

#### 2. Relocate and Modernize
*   **`ProjectOutlineHUD.tsx`**: Move from `builder/hud/` to `builder/outline/` for better domain grouping. Refactor it to use the shared primitives.
*   **`SidebarOutlineManager.tsx`**: Relocate to `builder/outline/`. Strip out the duplicated `SortableItem` and logic, refactoring it into a thin wrapper around the shared components.
*   **`OutlineManager.tsx`**: Since this was primarily a logic wrapper, I will integrate its logic into `useOutlineOperations` and use the HUD component directly in the workspace.

#### 3. Audit & Design Consistency
*   **Naming**: Standardize on `ProjectOutlineHUD` (Floating) and `SidebarOutlineManager` (Docked).
*   **Aesthetic**: Ensure both shared the same radial dot grids, high-density technical labels (`text-[9px] font-black uppercase`), and pulse indicators.
*   **DDD**: Ensure the clipboard logic and UUID generation follow the patterns established in the project (generating IDs in the application layer).

#### 4. Relink & Cleanup
*   Update imports in `BuilderWorkspace.tsx` and `SidebarNavigator.tsx`.
*   Perform a global `grep` for `OutlineManager` and `SidebarOutlineManager` to ensure no stale references remain in `report-mode`.

### Key Files:
*   `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/outline/SortableOutlineItem.tsx` (New)
*   `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/outline/useOutlineOperations.ts` (New)
*   `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/outline/ProjectOutlineHUD.tsx` (Refactor/Move)
*   `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/outline/SidebarOutlineManager.tsx` (Refactor/Move)

