### Refactoring Plan: Modular Generation System

#### 1. Consolidate Primitives (`src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/`)
*   **`GenerationNodeItem.tsx`**: A shared base for `SortableChapterItem` and `SectionAccordionItem`. It will provide the unified "Intelligence Suite" node look (technical indices, pulse indicators, drag handles).
*   **`GenerationControlsHUD.tsx`**: A shared base for `ChapterTabsPanel` and `SectionTabsPanel`. It will implement the high-density tabs and parameter controls.

#### 2. Relocate and Modernize
*   **`GenerationTools.tsx`** (formerly `index.tsx`): Relocate to `builder/generation/`.
    *   Refactor to use modular node items.
    *   Implement "Bulk Mode" vs "Focus Mode" visualization.
*   **`ChapterTabsPanel.tsx` & `SectionTabsPanel.tsx`**: Relocate to `builder/generation/`.
    *   Refactor into high-fidelity HUD panels.
    *   Standardize the parameter sliders and toggle groups.
*   **`SortableChapterItem.tsx` & `SectionAccordionItem.tsx`**: Relocate to `builder/generation/`.
    *   Refactor to use `GenerationNodeItem` for consistency.

#### 3. Audit & Design Consistency
*   **Naming**: Standardize on `ChapterGenerationHUD`, `SectionGenerationHUD`, and `GenerationNavigator`.
*   **Aesthetic**:
    *   Apply `bg-background/40 backdrop-blur-3xl` glassmorphism to the tool panels.
    *   Use the premium "Stable Version" manifest footers.
    *   Standardize technical labels (`text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest`).

#### 4. Relink & Cleanup
*   Update imports in `useSidebarPanels.tsx`.
*   Ensure state coordination (e.g., `activeChapterId` triggering the right HUD) works smoothly in the new architecture.
*   Remove the stale `report-mode/generation-tools/` directory.

### Key Files:
*   `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/GenerationNavigator.tsx` (Refactor/Move)
*   `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/ChapterGenerationHUD.tsx` (Refactor/Move)
*   `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/SectionGenerationHUD.tsx` (Refactor/Move)
*   `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/GenerationNodeItem.tsx` (New)

