2026-04-04 06:59:39.611 | 113525 (113525) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "### Refactoring Plan: Unified Modular Generation System\n\nConsolidate and modernize the AI generation control components within the modular Builder workspace, establishing a consistent \"Intelligence Suite\" aesthetic for parameter tuning and generation workflows.\n\n#### 1. Generation Infrastructure (`src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/generation/`)\n- **`GenerationNodeItem.tsx`**: Create a shared primitive for sortable generation nodes (Chapters and Sections). It will standardize the technical index display, status pulses, and drag interactions.\n- **`BaseGenerationHUD.tsx`**: Extract common parameter tuning UI (Tone selection, complexity sliders, guideline tags) used in both Chapter and Section panels.\n\n#### 2. Component Refactoring & Relocation\n- **`GenerationNavigator.tsx`** (formerly `generation-tools/index.tsx`):\n    - Relocate to `builder/generation/`.\n    - Refactor to use the shared `GenerationNodeItem`.\n    - Standardize the \"Bulk Build\" selection mode UI.\n- **`ChapterGenerationHUD.tsx` & `SectionGenerationHUD.tsx`** (formerly `*TabsPanel.tsx`):\n    - Relocate to `builder/generation/`.\n    - Modernize as high-fidelity floating panels with `backdrop-blur-3xl` and technical manifest footers.\n    - Standardize the \"Copy/Paste Logic\" and \"Intelligence Estimate\" displays.\n\n#### 3. Design & Naming Audit\n- **Intelligence Suite Consistency**: Use high-density technical labels (`text-[10px]`, `font-black`, `uppercase`, `tracking-widest`) and primary-tinted buttons.\n- **Atmospheric Alignment**: Integrate animated status pulses (green for ready, primary for generating) across all nodes and panels.\n\n#### 4. Relink & Cleanup\n- Update all consumers, primarily `useSidebarPanels.tsx` and `useReportGenerator.ts`.\n- Perform a post-rename reference sweep.\n- Remove the stale `report-mode/generation-tools/` directory.\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_924113209c38424cb56ebf22bc4f26ea", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
